        {
          "text": "Nkabela Jehova Leza wanu uyoomuvuzizya coolwe mumilimo yoonse yamaanza aanu, munyungu zyamibili yanu amunyungu zyaŋombe zyanu amunyungu zyamicelo yanyika yanu, nkaambo Jehova uyookondwa alimwi kumupa coolwe, mbubonya mbwaakakondwa kulibamausowanu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkokuti na mwaswiilila ijwi lya-Jehova Leza wanu akubamba milazyo yakwe ambeta zyakwe zilembedwe mubbuku eli lya-Mulao, na mwaboola kuli-Jehova Leza wanu camoyo woonse acamuuya woonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
