        {
          "text": "Amubone! Buzuba obuno ndamubikila buumi acoolwe, lufu amapenzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mwaswiilila milumbe ya-Jehova Leza wanu njendamulailila buzuba obuno, na mwayandisya, Jehova Leza wanu, na mweenda munzila zyakwe akubamba malailile aakwe amilazyo yakwe ambeta zyakwe, muyoopona akwaanda, nkabela Jehova Leza wanu uyoomulongezya omo munyika njemuyoovuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele na myoyo yanu yaleya, na mwabula kuswiilila, na mwaongelezegwa kukotamina baleza bambi milimo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
