              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndatamba ijulu anyika buzuba obuno, kuti zyoonse zibe bakamboni bangu, kuzibwe kuti buumi alufu, lulongezyo alutuko, zyoonse ndazibika kuti mulisalile. Amusale buumi, kuti mupone, nywebo abana banu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
